  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your paired souls fight as one, covering your weaknesses. You can’t be flanked by creatures of your level or lower. If you are currently harmonized, you don’t need to succeed at a flat check to target concealed creatures, and you only need a successful DC 5 flat check to target a hidden creature.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Symbiosis </strong>Your souls harmonize if you successfully make a flat check to target a concealed or hidden creature.</p>"
